The OSMesa context/render frontend/header is restored from Mesa 25.0.7.
OSMesaPostprocess and its removed filter stack are not included.

The selected profile is static softpipe OpenGL, no LLVM/JIT, GPU, DRM frontend,
GLX/EGL/GBM, GLES, dynamic loader or disk shader cache. Native integration uses
Pyxis's existing C11 synchronization and monotonic clock/sleep; it does not
identify Pyxis as POSIX or invent Unix process/file metadata. Unknown physical
memory/available CPU values remain unavailable. No formal API-conformance claim.

